    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shmooblin Blaster</i></strong> is a fast-paced bullet hell boss rush where you fight grotesque superbosses. Try to blast these nightmarish titans in their shifting weakpoints, while trying to dodge their increasingly desperate attacks to ultimately rescue your chained kin hanging above the battlefield. Each boss is a surreal, living sculpture with its own attack patterns and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
